    "imageUrl": "https://imagens.ebc.com.br/N91nJOrtUCdyy7c9MjMXFhYiU00=/1170x700/smart/https://agenciabrasil.ebc.com.br/sites/default/files/thumbnails/image/2026/10/29/cena-musical-caxtrinho-credito-andre-telles-espaco-cultural-bndes.jpg?itok=EbXV61-K",
    "imageCaption": "Cena Musical, da TV Brasil exibe show exclusivo do sambista Caxtrinho",
    "imageCredit": "TV Brasil",
